{#-
  case-study.njk — layout for case studies (docs/portfolio-clearance.md).
  A case study is a Portfolio Pudding scrollytelling page living inside the
  site: its styles are scoped to .story (assets/css/case-study.css plus its
  own file, both listed in the page's `pageStyles`), and it always ends with
  the practice-piece note. The page's front matter carries its clearance
  record; scripts/portfolio-check.js checks it at build time.
-#}
<script>try{if(localStorage.getItem("pudding-aud")==="pro")document.documentElement.setAttribute("data-aud","pro")}catch(e){}</script>
<div class="story">
{{ content | safe }}
</div>
<div class="story-note">
{% include "clearance-note.njk" %}
</div>
